<title>USA: MFS granted national license in Germany.</title>
<headline>MFS granted national license in Germany.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MFS Communications Co Inc said Friday its Germany subsidiary won a license to build and operate a telecommunications network in and between the cities of Berlin, Dusseldorf, Frankfurt, Hamburg, Cologne, Munich and Stuttgart.</p>
<p>The license, from the German Ministry of Post and Telecommunications, also enables MFS to build and operate international, cross-border telecommunications infrastructure from these cities.</p>
<p>It allows MFS networks to carry data, Internet services and closed user group voice services.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
